WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.042
The brand on one page:

00:00:02.092 --> 00:00:02.892
purpose,

00:00:02.776 --> 00:00:03.576
positioning,

00:00:03.554 --> 00:00:04.731
creative platform,

00:00:04.781 --> 00:00:06.889
and personality written as tensions.

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:09.922
Four short lines every team can work from.

00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:11.939
Telstra's page.

00:00:11.989 --> 00:00:14.781
Purpose: a connected future for everyone.

00:00:14.831 --> 00:00:17.470
Positioning: engineering possibility.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:20.151
Platform: wherever we go.

00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:24.591
Personality: ambitious in ideas, humble in voice.

00:00:24.641 --> 00:00:29.329
So the ads were handmade stop-motion, and viewers read that craft as care.

00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:31.186
Use it like this:

00:00:31.236 --> 00:00:32.318
write all four lines for the brand,

00:00:32.368 --> 00:00:36.831
then show how craft and consistency bring them to life.
